{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meowmunitions gives you a roguelike bullet hell experience with a unique gun customization mechanic where you can design your gun however you like.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The random nature of the game, with multiple different augments and artifacts, forces you to think of new and creative synergies to approach each run.  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Unique Augmenting System!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2685370/extras/62d87779f139726eadf60e69b488f374.poster.avif?t=1756307320\" width=640 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2685370/extras/62d87779f139726eadf60e69b488f374.webm?t=1756307320\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2685370/extras/62d87779f139726eadf60e69b488f374.mp4?t=1756307320\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Combining different augments to create CRAZY SYNERGIES.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Every augment can work together, so you'll never have to worry about running out of synergies!</strong>  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Variety And Replayability!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The random nature of the game ensures that each run is different and unique!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>With so many different augments and artifacts, you'll have to take a new and creative approach to each run.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Powerful Bosses!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Every boss has a unique mechanic, unlike no other game!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>It is as if each and every boss is a different game on its own!</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Even more fun playing with friends!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meowmunitions can be played solo, but you can also play it <strong>with friends </strong>via Steam Remote Play Together or the built-in online multiplayer. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Equipped with a customized gun, you explore procedurally generated worlds. Along the way, you receive many rewards, ranging from passive artifacts and potions to augments for further customizing your gun.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gun customization is one of the key mechanics that drives the game\u2019s strategic depth. Since the game drops random augments rather than specific ones, you can never be sure what kind of gun you'll end up with. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You begin the game with limited power, facing only a few enemies, but their numbers grow exponentially as you advance. And at the end of each map, you\u2019ll have to face off a boss with unique mechanics, testing your build and skill. To survive, you'll need to carefully decide which items to buy, which artifacts to equip, and how you design your gun.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Learn the ways!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2685370/8139e3d32f9d9eec4ebcf383d5896f71c571c1c8.jpg"},{"name":"King of the forest!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2685370/c6fb3d4b5b1096bbf62c7f246159c0a7d5f05f4f.jpg"},{"name":"Unveil the mystic forest!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2685370/dbd7fbdc20652b2813fcf3b91915ed4dbc1ae551.jpg"},{"name":"Traverse the desert!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2685370/2b81993488425db9d7f86deff87f4f33bca32a06.jpg"},{"name":"Conquer the snow mountain!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2685370/0a0bda536d7c62b8597d214db0dc0ea3196ad548.jpg"},{"name":"Seize the volcano!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2685370/334dadc1d81dd54db884c1f513f77d9ea4af06ee.jpg"},{"name":"Uncover the final mystery!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2685370/4518dbf15164d333a337e7caa064cfb3748cd09b.jpg"},{"name":"LASER GUN!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2685370/0a0507b2e3947c110f72923a4d324cd48ea6f576.jpg"},{"name":"Where's the bullet?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2685370/b24e52222a4b154cf34c8918669b28ce6dbf907b.jpg"},{"name":"So many bullets","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2685370/abce059780fe1f6d21660dc07e134fdf20ce3602.jpg"}],"total":32},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2685370?t=1756307320","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2685370/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1756307320","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2685370/ca34d46251c9e5a7815dfdf8aa6843cb51e3b574/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1756307320","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2685370/ca34d46251c9e5a7815dfdf8aa6843cb51e3b574/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1756307320","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"LAN Co-op","id":48},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen Co-op","id":39},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Cross-Platform Multiplayer","id":27},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":2827940,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meowmunitions gives you a roguelike bullet hell experience with a unique gun customization mechanic where you can design your gun however you like.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The random nature of the game, with multiple different augments and artifacts, forces you to think of new and creative synergies to approach each run.  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Unique Augmenting System!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2685370/extras/62d87779f139726eadf60e69b488f374.poster.avif?t=1756307320\" width=640 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2685370/extras/62d87779f139726eadf60e69b488f374.webm?t=1756307320\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2685370/extras/62d87779f139726eadf60e69b488f374.mp4?t=1756307320\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Combining different augments to create CRAZY SYNERGIES.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Every augment can work together, so you'll never have to worry about running out of synergies!</strong>  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Variety And Replayability!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The random nature of the game ensures that each run is different and unique!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>With so many different augments and artifacts, you'll have to take a new and creative approach to each run.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Powerful Bosses!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Every boss has a unique mechanic, unlike no other game!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>It is as if each and every boss is a different game on its own!</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Even more fun playing with friends!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meowmunitions can be played solo, but you can also play it <strong>with friends </strong>via Steam Remote Play Together or the built-in online multiplayer. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Equipped with a customized gun, you explore procedurally generated worlds. Along the way, you receive many rewards, ranging from passive artifacts and potions to augments for further customizing your gun.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gun customization is one of the key mechanics that drives the game\u2019s strategic depth. Since the game drops random augments rather than specific ones, you can never be sure what kind of gun you'll end up with. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You begin the game with limited power, facing only a few enemies, but their numbers grow exponentially as you advance. And at the end of each map, you\u2019ll have to face off a boss with unique mechanics, testing your build and skill. To survive, you'll need to carefully decide which items to buy, which artifacts to equip, and how you design your gun.</p>","developers":["Pete Karesisto"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2685370/44d79a7686e3a54bbbfd0079eb3cf9c1fc5ccd28/header.jpg?t=1756307320","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Any<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 1 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 500 MB available space</li></ul>"},"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2685370/1656808124/fd99010b895e60505c